# SPD adjustment corpus (DESIGN-SPD Q1): Slingshot's MainTransformation on every path.
# Generated by qvto-testkit/tools/gen-spd-corpus.py (models in corpus/spd/q1, derived from
# Palladio-Documentation-Slingshot examples/minimalexample (commit 94448159e75f33edfb98e960ad244018b97e37d4) and the SPD metamodel Palladio-Addons-SPD-Metamodel (commit 95cdb0b677276f5d14c3001b89705a17d8fb690f);
# licence pending confirmation, DESIGN-SPD U3). The transformations bind the models by
# nsURI in Slingshot; here positionally, in the signature's order.

case spd_min_step_plus1
driver slingshot.SpdAdjustmentBehavior
kind spd-adjustment
dir qvto-testkit/corpus/spd
qvto transformations/spd/MainTransformation.qvto
in q1/min/default.allocation
in q1/min/default.system
in q1/min/My.resourceenvironment
in q1/min/default.repository
in q1/min/default.spd
in q1/min/min_step_plus1.semanticspd
in q1/min/default.usagemodel
conf target/pcm/pcm.conf
imports root qvto-testkit/corpus/spd/transformations
config keepModeling=true
source Palladio-Addons-SPD-Metamodel/bundles/org.palladiosimulator.spd.semantic.transformations/transformations
note the example's policy: scale-out by one, load balancer gets a branch; models in q1/min (gen-spd-corpus.py; licence pending confirmation)
dump models
resolve-all
end

